  "body": "Positioned to capture the northern sun, with a green outlook across the former golf course towards the sea, and outdoor entertaining that encourages good times with great mates - 17 Fingal Way delivers laid-back Gulf Harbour living with a little extra wow factor. Our sellers have their sights set on their next home and highly motivated to make it work, so now is the time to act on this one.\r\n\r\nThe covered outdoor entertaining area, complete with adjustable louvres and integrated lighting, sets the scene for everything from sunny brunches to long afternoons with friends. Rendered brick construction, steel framing and an HRV system add to the appeal, all set on a 627sqm freehold site. With Wentworth schools and Gulf Harbour Primary within walking distance, plus the marina, ferry, golf and coastal walkways close by, you're perfectly placed to enjoy the best of Gulf Harbour living!\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* Four bedrooms, two bathrooms, two living areas\r\n* North-facing with excellent natural light\r\n* Outdoor entertaining deck with adjustable louvres and integrated lighting\r\n* HRV ventilation system\r\n* Rendered brick construction and steel framing\r\n* Double internal-access garage\r\n* 627sqm freehold section\r\n* Fully fenced back yard for the dog\r\n* Easy walk to Wentworth College & Primary\r\n\r\nIf you've been searching for a spacious Gulf Harbour home with views, sunshine and an exceptional entertaining lifestyle, this is your opportunity.\r\n\r\nAUCTION: Thursday 26th November from 12:00pm (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/Y4LM\r\n\r\n- Flexible settlement terms available\r\n- Other agents bring your buyers, conjunctionals welcome",
